# as-headroom (Headroom, context compression between as-llm-gw and LiteLLM).
# The token as-llm-gw sends as X-Headroom-Proxy-Token; Headroom refuses anyone without it
# (it listens on as-net-blind). Both containers read this file. Generated by gen-secrets.sh.
HEADROOM_PROXY_TOKEN=CHANGE_ME_HEADROOM_PROXY_TOKEN
